sequenceDiagram
  participant F as Frontend
  participant A as API
  participant D as DB
  participant P as Provider
  F->>A: POST /v1/runs + Idempotency-Key
  A->>D: authorize + reserve budget + run/event/outbox
  A-->>F: 202 run + events URL
  F->>A: GET events (Last-Event-ID)
  A->>P: execute
  P-->>A: deltas/usage
  A->>D: append events/citations/finalize ledger
  A-->>F: replay + live SSE
